SUMMARY:2026 Ethnic Studies Summer Institute
DESCRIPTION:Please note: this event is off site at Eastern Oregon University \n\n\n\nThis is a two-day educator workshop with sessions on Tuesday\, July 28 and Wednesday\, July 29\, from 9am to 4pm.Registration Deadline: Friday\, May 29\, 2026Free and open to the public \n\n\n\nEastern Oregon UniversityOne University BlvdLa Grande\, Oregon 97850 \n\n\n\nTeaching a More Complete Oregon History through Integrated Ethnic Studies  \n\n\n\nExpand the narrative of Oregon history using Integrated Ethnic Studies! Learn from local organizations\, collaborate and lesson plan with fellow educators\, and leave with classroom-ready resources for teaching a more complete Oregon history that includes the contributions and perspectives of Black\, Chinese\, Japanese\, and Latine Oregonians; tribal history and Native nations; and Holocaust\, genocide\, and human rights education.  \n\n\n\nThis free two-day educator workshop (July 28–29\, from 9am–4pm) will feature customized sessions for grades K–5\, 6–8\, and 9–12 presented by the Oregon Historical Society\, the Japanese American Museum of Oregon\, Oregon Black Pioneers\, the Oregon Jewish Museum and Center for Holocaust Education\, and the Portland Art Museum. Each session will introduce educators to resources they can use to support the implementation of the 2024 Oregon Social Science Standards\, with a focus on Integrated Ethnic Studies\, Place-Based Histories\, and Holocaust\, Genocide\, and Human Rights Education.  \n\n\n\nParticipants will be eligible for PDUs and rural educators will be eligible for a stipend at the conclusion of the Ethnic Studies Summer Institute. Coffee\, snacks\, and lunch will be provided each day. \n\n\n\nMore Info
URL:https://jamo.org/event/ethnic-studies-summer-institute/
LOCATION:Eastern Oregon University\, One University Blvd\, La Grande\, Oregon\, 97850
CATEGORIES:Education,For Teachers,Partner Event,Workshop
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://jamo.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/ohs2026.jpg
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR